# DVCC runtime data never belongs in the repository.
# Runtime data lives under %APPDATA%\DevVault-Control (release) or %APPDATA%\DevVault-Control-dev (debug).
# If DVCC_DATA_DIR is pointed inside the working tree for local experiments, use this folder name.
.dvcc-data/
